1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,939
Every morning my to-do list
got longer.

2
00:00:03,009 --> 00:00:04,346
And I started nothing.

3
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:05,392
I'm Alex,

4
00:00:05,392 --> 00:00:07,816
building a focus timer
on my own.

5
00:00:07,886 --> 00:00:09,875
Three of five beta features
shipped.

6
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:11,952
A long list makes you choose
first.

7
00:00:12,022 --> 00:00:13,309
Choosing feels like work —

8
00:00:13,309 --> 00:00:15,298
so you open email instead.

9
00:00:15,980 --> 00:00:17,504
So the app asks one thing:

10
00:00:17,504 --> 00:00:18,841
what is the one task?

11
00:00:18,911 --> 00:00:20,248
Then one timer starts.

12
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,227
Twenty-five minutes,

13
00:00:22,227 --> 00:00:22,912
one task.

14
00:00:22,982 --> 00:00:25,623
And no streak to lose if you
skip tomorrow.

15
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:27,769
It's in public beta on iOS.

16
00:00:27,839 --> 00:00:29,611
Tell me what breaks
your focus.
